# The site is generated on Windows by hand and on Linux by the hourly Arlo sync.
# Without this, Git's autocrlf setting on a Windows machine can flip line endings
# and make every generated file look changed, which would commit the whole site
# every hour for no reason.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
